original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"xSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"E6290DCA-A535-49D3-B9F6-1807E23BCF80","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"うーん。それは自分で本当に必要なのを出すとか、コンパイルのほうのロガー変えるとかかなぁ","ts":"1617282674.114800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"eiPe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc2e884d-f03f-48df-b34a-937d7c6c5bd1","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あとコンパイルした結果をログに出すと、本当のSQLクエリのログとコンパイルして出力した結果が混ってしまうというのもあり。。\n(いやこれは適切にフィルタしろよという話ではあるんですが。)","ts":"1617282599.113500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T+7Og"}]},{"client_msg_id":"418eadf9-aae5-423d-a3aa-6fca3f292d6a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"あー。そうですね。コンパイルは既に試していて、一番でかいSQLはコンパイルした結果を出してるのですが、他の雑多なクエリがそのままプレースホルダの形式でログにでてるのです。","ts":"1617282460.113300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nGCa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"349A379E-EE19-4BF9-BBEC-69DBBC132FEE","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"渡ってくる context の中にはいってないと見ましたがなかったので、掘るしかないですねー","ts":"1617282374.112100","thread_ts":"1617282244.109800","subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6bya"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"55ffb403-534f-499f-af77-9aadcafc7b30","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`sys._getframe()` ってコールスタックを掘るのか\nまぁ、そうするしかないよな…","ts":"1617282244.109800","thread_ts":"1617282244.109800","reply_count":1,"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5PHn"}]}},{"client_msg_id":"5abbb8e4-ec3b-49d6-894c-6ad557c6cbd2","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`print(q.statement.compile(compile_kwargs={\"literal_binds\": True}))` とかかな","ts":"1617282315.110900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"ri