","text":"ただ叩いた場所を取るのはもう少し工夫が必要そう。","ts":"1617280530.102700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"LCR5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6d46936-fb00-4f7c-8dab-cc4fb8c5e368","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"それです。","ts":"1617280511.102300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"1Xh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a3827f18-24c7-46d7-8697-c1d4da0ac118","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"これかな？","ts":"1617280503.102100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"eyes","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cOCe"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e508c6ac-a613-441a-8a94-f948b1a886fb","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"\u003chttps://docs.sqlalchemy.org/en/13/core/events.html\u003e","ts":"1617280500.101900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9nj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"65426110-3d17-48e0-8f94-26d7040362ab","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"session.query()したときには実際はクエリはまだ出てないです。","ts":"1617280217.101700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"zaFGG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a6517fcc-81cb-41a1-b741-7b89faf39cc5","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"ちょっと確認中。","ts":"1617280174.101500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BZ7h"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e6a1716-b73b-4d64-a8e9-1d85fb22d316","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"自分がやるのならおそらく event 作ると思います。","ts":"1617280171.101200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"f4DQD"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1329d330-58a9-44a4-8540-0b83e878472b","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"queryメソッドを呼ぶときと、実際にクエリが出るのは違うタイミングなんですよね。。","ts":"1617280165.101000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iFGj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"320a029e-1dc0-41b2-95ca-660912ed5973","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"私もPython経験皆無なので、他言語経験からなんですが","ts":"1617280045.100500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ll0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"00195999-36f3-4ecc-9798-77bf23cba160","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`sqlalchemy.orm.Query` 継承したクラスを作って、query メソッドを叩く前にログを出すようなメソッドを用意すればいいんじゃないでしょうか","ts":"1617280015.099700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j58Jm"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8197fe3c-036f-4e8e-96a2-26d1be940c1a","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"query().statementを毎回ログに出すにはどうするんでしょう。。？すいません、Python経験が浅く。。","ts":"1617279791.097700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"9NuoW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c6ae58a4-3b6c-46f6-8b05-9b17d4ab9632","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"デバッグモードだと、 `query().statement` を毎回ログに出るようにしておくとかだと、どこから呼ばれるか分かるかも…？","ts":"1617279633.097500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZLC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1be6c02d-0c5d-4e33-8bac-c813088f2637","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"そうです。知らぬ間に巨大になっていて、変なところからクエリが出てるんですが、それがどこか分からず。。","ts":"1617279275.095900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UIN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6f4010cb-4b23-4d03-a7f8-2032b64f51f1","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"```...\naccounts = session.query(Account).all()```\nの all() の行数(場所)を知りたいということでしょうか？","ts":"1617278619.095300","edited":{"user":"U78A6ESHM","ts":"1617278814.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/ydn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"192f2f96-29f3-4e87-869f-164d9ab65c63","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"sqlalchemyのログは出てるんですが、sqlalchemyの中の行が出るんですよね。。\n```sqlalchemy.engine.base.Engine:log.py:110 WITH a AS ...```","ts":"1617276593.094600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"W+99N"}]},{"client_msg_id":"07c406fe-c807-493b-85d2-c9b9fe865da9","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"sqlalchemyのクエリが叩かれたPythonコードの行が知りたいんですが、良さそうな方法ありますでしょうか。。？","ts":"1617276501.094000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"KTFcc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4779971-e96c-4b4d-bee4-f9dcdd9ad7be","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"conda後pipは良いけどpip後condaはいけないんでしたっけ。\npytorchの最新版がpipじゃないとインストールできないとか辛いなと思ってました。","ts":"1617232231.093800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5z5Zx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7858b9db-754b-4c91-8ebf-752d9dcdabfa","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"conda で完結するなら良いんですけど、 pip じゃないとインストールできないものとかあったりして辛かったり…","ts":"1617230458.093600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MXF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd4bfc82-710e-41f7-a6cc-3eb5b186ecd6","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"conda入れるなら全部condaにするという強い気持ちが必要","ts":"1617229931.092800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ure"}]}]
